# Browser
# Gift promised, as a person sees it: the question as Into the Flood Maw is cast says what the gift is, "a tapped Fish", and what Bot2 gets, not a bare "a gift".
# The same game as the file that returns Bot2's Mox Pearl with the gift: Bot2 ends with a tapped Fish (CR 702.174f).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Into the Flood Maw
Ornithopter
Plains x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Mox Pearl
Plains
Plains x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Into the Flood Maw.Cast
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Title = Into the Flood Maw: promise an opponent a tapped Fish?
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Detail = They create a tapped 1/1 blue Fish creature token before the spell's other effects, and the card does more if you do
Bot1.Accept
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Plains)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

